#: ../main.lua:1008
msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Nasveti za uporabo\n"
"\n"
"Izberite:\n"
"Označite besedilo (ali besedo) v knjigi, nato pritisnite [AI assistant] v pojavnem meniju.\n"
"\n"
"Dolg pritisk:\n"
"- Na gumbu Prompt: Dodajte v meni označb.\n"
"- Na gumbu v meniju označb, da ga odstranite.\n"
"- Na gumbu Zapri, da se v enem koraku vrnete v knjigo.\n"
"\n"
"Zelo dolg pritisk (več kot 3 sekunde):\n"
"Na posamezno besedo v knjigi, da se prikaže meni označb (namesto slovarja).\n"
"\n"
"Večkratni poteg (npr. ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"Na pogovornem oknu z rezultatom, da ga zaprete (ker je gumb Zapri težko dosegljiv).\n"

